-- Horde 1-60 levelling route for WoW Forever. Quest IDs are QuestieDB's; NPCs, objects and
-- coordinates are filled in from QuestieDB. Rebuilt by Tests/route_import.py.
-- Route adapted from github.com/fitzforge/polestar v0.3.7.2 (guides/forever), GPL-3.0-only.
-- t: A=accept C=complete T=turn in D=dungeon G=go to N=note SH=set hearth H=hearth
--    FP=get flight path F=fly TR=train
-- q = quest ID, z = zone (AreaTable) ID, x/y = map percent coords, instance = dungeon area ID
-- (the arrow points at that dungeon's entrance), target = NPC/object/item to interact with,
-- races/classes = only show for these ('!' = everyone except).
-- foreverOnly = true marks a quest that is new in WoW Forever (not in Classic Era).
-- obj = N: the step is objective N of its quest; optional = true: never holds you up;
-- place = the stop on the route the step belongs to.
-- Only while it holds (checked as you play): lvlBelow/lvlMin = level, part-way levels too (16.51);
-- moneyMin = copper; noSkill = skill not learned; skill = skill learned; notKnown = spell or
-- recipe not known; bound/notBound = hearthstone; onQuest = any in
-- your log; solo = N: you've neither done nor got quest N (the way past a group quest);
-- ready = Q: Q is in your log ready to hand in; hasBelow = {item, N}: fewer than N in your bags;
-- hasAtLeast = {item, N}: N or more; turnedIn/notTurnedIn = {Q...}: all handed in / none;
-- notOnQuest = {Q...}: none in your log; notReady = Q: Q isn't ready to hand in;
-- available = {Q...}: each can be taken now; inZone = the zone you're in.
-- direct = true: a hand-in straight from the giver's window (the quest is never in your log).
-- was = N: the step's number in the route this one replaced (your place moves over).
