  {t="N", text="Poison chain unfinished? Resume your current stage in the Class guide Poisons (Horde); completed quests do not need restarting. Arrange a group for Gallywix, finish the Hinott follow-up, then return to this leveling guide.", classes={"Rogue"}, section="Hillsbrad Foothills (22-25)", p=721, place="Serge Hinott"}, -- 2115
