  {t="G", text="Grimtotem camps below Darkcloud Pinnacle", z=400, x=35.0, y=31.5, tip="Short of 28.9? The Grimtotem around these camps (25-28) are the right level: kill a few more before the climb to Lakota. Past it, this step skips itself. Or, with a group, run the Blackfathom Deeps dungeon or the Razorfen Kraul dungeon instead.", lvlBelow=28.9, section="Ashenvale & Thousand Needles (26-30)", zoneName="Thousand Needles", p=863, place="Level 28.9"}, -- 2428
  {t="N", text="Reach level 28.9", note="grind on Grimtotem Stomper", lvlBelow=28.9, section="Ashenvale & Thousand Needles (26-30)", p=863, place="Level 28.9"}, -- 2429
  {t="C", q=5147, name="WANTED: Arnak Grimtotem", z=400, x=38.1, y=26.9, note="Arnak Grimtotem", tip="Climb the path to the top of Darkcloud Pinnacle. Lakota Windsong is held captive beside Arnak Grimtotem (29): clear the guards and Arnak first, then free her and protect her on the walk down; Grimtotem ambushers come at you on the way.", section="Ashenvale & Thousand Needles (26-30)", zoneName="Thousand Needles", p=864, place="Lakota Windsong", was=2231}, -- 2430
