  {t="N", text="Lesser Troll's Blood Elixir: auction house or an alchemist, for Elixir of Agony.", tip="Elixir of Agony needs a Lesser Troll's Blood Elixir, an Alchemy item: buy one at the auction house if you can (or ask an alchemist). The quest text says Strong, but it takes a Lesser Troll's Blood Elixir. No elixir: skip the Elixir steps in Hillsbrad.", section="Hillsbrad Foothills & Arathi Highlands (29-33)", p=891, place="The Undercity"}, -- 2484
