  {t="C", q=575, name="Supply and Demand", gv="Collect", gw="Large River Crocolisk Skin", z=33, x=34.58, y=10.46, note="Collect Large River Crocolisk Skin", tip="River Crocolisks lie along the river below the camp. Young Stranglethorn Tigers prowl west of the camp, Young Panthers east of it. Head west past the camp. Stranglethorn Raptors (33-34) hunt the clearings, and the Bloodscalp trolls hold the ruins on the coast: every Bloodscalp can drop a tusk. A Pendant of Myzrael is a very rare drop from them: if one drops, read it. Careful: The troll camps have many patrolling mobs, so other trolls often join a fight.", section="Stranglethorn Vale (34-36)", zoneName="Stranglethorn Vale", p=994, place="Nesingwary's Expedition: kill these as you meet them", was=2549}, -- 2777
