  {t="C", q=186, name="Tiger Mastery", gv="Kill", gw="Stranglethorn Tiger", z=33, x=36.2, y=13.2, note="Kill Stranglethorn Tiger", tip="Stranglethorn Tigers (32) roam the hills around the camp and south of it, Panthers (32) the clearings west and south-west of it. The Venture Co. Geologists, who carry the Tumbled Crystals, work the camps by Lake Nazferiti, south-east of the camp.", section="Stranglethorn Vale (34-36)", zoneName="Stranglethorn Vale", p=996, place="Stranglethorn Vale: kill these as you meet them", was=2556}, -- 2787
