  {t="G", text="Mosh'Ogg camp", z=33, x=36.7, y=31.9, tip="Dustwallow's quests are 35-38. Still below 36 after Grom'gol's hand-ins? The Mosh'Ogg Brutes and Witch Doctors camp in the hills just east of the camp: kill them until level 36, pulling one at a time, then walk back to the zeppelin tower. Or, with a group, run the Scarlet Monastery dungeon (Armory) or the Razorfen Downs dungeon instead.", lvlBelow=36.0, section="Stranglethorn Vale (34-36)", zoneName="Stranglethorn Vale", p=1016, place="Level 36"}, -- 2865
