  {t="G", text="Professor Phizzlethorpe", z=45, x=33.9, y=80.6, tip="Escort the professor up the hill to the cave above the cove and guard him while he works. Two level 40 water elementals ambush him there, and they are immune to frost. Hold them at the cave mouth, away from him: if the fight happens inside the cave, he joins in instead of working and more elementals keep coming.", section="Alterac Mountains & Arathi Highlands (38-39)", zoneName="Arathi Highlands", p=1090, place="Professor Phizzlethorpe"}, -- 3029
