  {t="G", text="Skullsplitter warriors", z=33, x=45.4, y=36.2, tip="Head north to the Skullsplitter ruins east of the Venture Co. mine; pull the headhunters and berserkers one at a time. Ana'thek the Cruel guards the south-western ruins, and one pile of trophy skulls stands on the ruins' north side. Every Skullsplitter can drop a tusk or a necklace: the necklaces are the slow part, so keep killing in the warriors' camp north of the ruins until you have them all.", section="Stranglethorn Vale & Swamp of Sorrows (39-43)", zoneName="Stranglethorn Vale", p=1136, place="Zul'Mamwe"}, -- 3182
