  {t="TR", text="Train with Velma Warnam", optional=true, z=85, x=60.08, y=52.57, note="Velma Warnam, riding trainer", tip="Riding needs level 40 and costs 100 gold; learning it gives you a mount. Each race learns it from its own race's trainer: yours is Velma Warnam in Brill, a short ride north of the zeppelin towers, with Zachariah Post's skeletal horses (20 gold each) beside her. Ride back to the towers for the Grom'gol zeppelin.", races={"undead"}, lvlMin=40.0, section="Feralas, Dustwallow Marsh & Swamp of Sorrows (45-47)", zoneName="Tirisfal Glades", p=1217, place="Riding at 40"}, -- 3411
