  {t="N", text="Keep the parcel: Royal Overseer Bauhaus is in the Undercity. Keep A Plague Upon Thee: its termite mounds are in Terrordale, on the next guide's ride to Tirion. The next guide starts with Mulgris Deepriver by the Writhing Haunt, south-east of here.", section="Un'Goro Crater, Burning Steppes & Western Plaguelands (51-53)", p=1446, place="Janice Felstone"}, -- 4004
